aid_credits_require_payment_confirmation", "expected": "runtime finding (refutes the research claim of immediate settlement): with no payment provider a paid_credits POST leaves the purchased inbound PENDING and the wallet balance at 0; credits settle only after the credit invoice is marked paid (PUT payment_status=succeeded -> PrepaidCreditJob -> ApplyPaidCreditsService), which is exactly the WeKnora Payment-Fact -> Lago-fulfillment seam", "observed": {"balance_before_confirmation_cents": 0, "balance_cents": 5000, "confirm_http_status": 200, "invoice_id": "70426102-24cf-48f9-8e84-58f17f55d9a1", "note": "no payment provider configured in this lab, mirroring the Community no-provider default; settlement requires the payment fact (PUT payment_status=succeeded)", "payment_status_before": "pending", "settled": true, "settled_within_seconds": 0.0, "spendable_confirmed": true}, "outcome": "pass"}], "cleanup": [{"kind": "wallet", "outcome": "terminated", "target": "bcaa89ed-9cd5-4261-8281-8b625ec3f491"}, {"kind": "customer", "outcome": "deleted", "target": "weknora-t03-cust-d6c3e9f3-4a36-4fd5-98e5-f81a144b2c23"}, {"kind": "wallet", "outcome": "terminated", "target": "74074a6e-e7c9-4242-8d43-802df15c2143"}, {"kind": "customer", "outcome": "deleted", "target": "weknora-t03-cust-4a1a23d6-99b0-485e-8e38-88f51e8d57c9"}, {"kind": "wallet", "outcome": "terminated", "target": "078a0d73-4890-4b79-bedd-cda4976b2893"}, {"kind": "customer", "outcome": "deleted", "target": "weknora-t03-cust-dff7aab4-279b-42e4-b539-9464da379da9"}, {"kind": "wallet", "outcome": "terminated", "target": "72f239ac-a730-4fdc-aa15-b2bea855dc2e"}, {"kind": "customer", "outcome": "deleted", "target": "weknora-t03-cust-a26f1c87-b1ac-488c-bd00-9c553b64cb32"}, {"kind": "wallet", "outcome": "terminated", "target": "abc4fd7a-4ba1-4d5f-ae6c-458798b9d8ac"}, {"kind": "customer", "outcome": "deleted", "target": "weknora-t03-cust-880b17a9-8f59-4515-adf6-91d6f0c4c3bc"}, {"kind": "wallet", "outcome": "terminated", "target"